<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover, maximum-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#15141C">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<title>운명상회</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#15141C; --ink-2:#1E1C28; --ink-3:#272433; --line:#322E40;
    --gold:#ECC55A; --gold-soft:#C99A33;
    --paper:#F2EEE3; --paper-dim:#9A9489; --paper-faint:#6E6A60;
    --danger:#DD6354; --good:#65AE72;
    --el-mok:#65AE72; --el-hwa:#DD6354; --el-to:#DBA13E; --el-geum:#ECC55A; --el-su:#5C93C9;
    --radius:14px; --radius-sm:10px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html,body{height:100%}
  [hidden]{display:none !important}
  body{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:"Noto Sans KR",system-ui,-apple-system,"Apple SD Gothic Neo",sans-serif;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .app{position:relative;max-width:430px;margin:0 auto;height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:radial-gradient(900px 480px at 50% -8%, #221F2E 0%, rgba(34,31,46,0) 58%), var(--ink);border-left:1px solid var(--line);border-right:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden}
  .sfx-toggle{position:absolute;top:9px;right:11px;z-index:60;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(18,16,26,.72);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);transition:border-color .15s ease,color .15s ease,opacity .15s ease}
  .sfx-toggle:hover{border-color:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold)}
  .sfx-toggle:active{transform:scale(.94)}
  .sfx-toggle.off{opacity:.55}
  .ohaeng-strip{display:flex;height:4px;flex:none}
  .ohaeng-strip span{flex:1}
  .ohaeng-strip span:nth-child(1){background:var(--el-mok)} .ohaeng-strip span:nth-child(2){background:var(--el-hwa)}
  .ohaeng-strip span:nth-child(3){background:var(--el-to)} .ohaeng-strip span:nth-child(4){background:var(--el-geum)}
  .ohaeng-strip span:nth-child(5){background:var(--el-su)}

  .stage{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  .screen{display:none;flex:1;flex-direction:column;padding:22px 22px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
  .screen.active{display:flex;animation:fade .35s ease}
  @keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .phase-badge{align-self:flex-start;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;font-weight:700;color:var(--paper-dim);text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:3px 10px;margin-bottom:14px}

  /* 온보딩 */
  #onboarding{justify-content:center}
  .ob-brand{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:46px;color:var(--paper);letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .ob-sub{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:500;font-size:16px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:30px}
  .field{margin-bottom:20px}
  .field > label{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px}
  .opt{color:var(--paper-faint);font-weight:500}
  .input,.sel{width:100%;background:#100F16;color:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:13px 14px;font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;transition:border-color .15s ease}
  .input::placeholder{color:var(--paper-faint)}
  .input:focus,.sel:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--gold)}
  .date-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
  .sel{appearance:none;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='12' height='8' viewBox='0 0 12 8'><path d='M1 1l5 5 5-5' stroke='%239A9489' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/></svg>");background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right 13px center;padding-right:32px}
  .err{color:var(--danger);font-size:12.5px;margin:-8px 0 16px;min-height:18px;font-weight:500}
  .btn-primary{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-soft));color:#1A150A;font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:15px;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:filter .15s ease,transform .05s ease;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(236,197,90,.18)}
  .btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)} .btn-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--paper);outline-offset:3px}
  .ob-note{text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--paper-faint);margin-top:14px}

  /* 상태바 / 헤더 */
  .statusbar{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .stat-pill{flex:1;background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}
  .stat-pill b{color:var(--paper);font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .stat-pill .gold{color:var(--gold)}
  .scr-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .scr-eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}
  .scr-title{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:28px;color:var(--paper);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.15}
  .scr-meta{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin-top:7px}
  .icon-btn{flex:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);border-radius:99px;font-size:11.5px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:500;padding:7px 12px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s ease;white-space:nowrap}
  .icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--danger);color:var(--danger)}
  .icon-btn.armed{border-color:var(--danger);color:var(--danger);background:rgba(221,99,84,.10)}
  .icon-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}

  /* 운세 */
  .sealed{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;gap:18px;padding:30px 10px}
  .seal-mark{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:52px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%, #2A2636, #161420);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(236,197,90,.06),0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);animation:breathe 3.4s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes breathe{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.03)}}
  .seal-text{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:17px;color:var(--paper-dim)}
  .sealed .btn-primary{max-width:320px}
  .stats{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .stat-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:6px}
  .stat-name{font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500}
  .stat-val{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--paper)}
  .stat-val small{font-size:12px;color:var(--paper-faint);font-weight:700;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .bar{height:9px;background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}
  .bar > i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;border-radius:99px;transition:width .9s cubic-bezier(.3,0,.2,1)}
  .luck-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .luck-chip{flex:1;background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
  .luck-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .luck-main{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;color:var(--paper);margin-top:1px}
  .color-dot{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
  .num-badge{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:17px}
  .fortune-comment{background:#191722;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px 14px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin-bottom:22px}
  .fortune-comment b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .reward-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px}
  .flip{perspective:1200px;width:100%;height:236px;margin:0 auto 14px}
  .flip-inner{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
  .flip.flipped .flip-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
  .flip-face{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .flip-back{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%, #2A2636, #15131E);gap:10px}
  .flip-back .bk-mark{font-size:46px;opacity:.85} .flip-back .bk-text{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-faint);letter-spacing:.2em}
  .flip-front{transform:rotateY(180deg);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#221F2D,#171520);--glow:var(--gold)}
  .flip.flipped .flip-front{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04),0 0 34px -4px var(--glow);animation:pop .5s ease}
  @keyframes pop{0%{transform:rotateY(180deg) scale(.94)}60%{transform:rotateY(180deg) scale(1.02)}100%{transform:rotateY(180deg) scale(1)}}
  .item-glyph{font-size:54px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px;filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4))}
  .item-name{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:21px;color:var(--paper);text-align:center}
  .grade-chip{margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink);background:var(--glow);border-radius:99px;padding:3px 12px}
  .item-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--paper-dim);background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:3px 10px}
  .next-hint{text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--paper-faint);margin-top:4px}
  .next-hint b{color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700}

  /* 상점 플레이 */
  .session-stats{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .sstat{flex:1;background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:9px 6px;text-align:center}
  .sstat span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:3px}
  .sstat b{font-family:"Noto Serif KR";font-size:18px;color:var(--paper);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .sstat b.gold{color:var(--gold)}
  .cust-stage{position:relative;background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, #231F30, #16131F);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;min-height:188px;overflow:hidden}
  .queue{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px;height:30px}
  .qav{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:16px;opacity:.55}
  .qav.vip{border-color:var(--gold-soft);opacity:.8}
  .front-cust{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .bubble{background:var(--paper);color:#1A1622;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:14px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.3);max-width:90%;text-align:center}
  .bubble::after{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-7px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);border:7px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--paper);border-bottom:0}
  .bubble em{font-style:normal;color:var(--danger)}
  .bubble.selling{background:var(--good);color:#0E1A10} .bubble.selling::after{border-top-color:var(--good)}
  .bubble.happy{background:var(--gold)} .bubble.happy::after{border-top-color:var(--gold)}
  .bubble.angry{background:#3A2622;color:#F0C9C2} .bubble.angry::after{border-top-color:#3A2622}
  .bubble.bye{background:#2A2636;color:var(--paper-dim)} .bubble.bye::after{border-top-color:#2A2636}
  .cust-av{width:66px;height:66px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%,#2C2838,#181522);border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:36px;transition:transform .2s ease}
  .front-cust.vip .cust-av{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(236,197,90,.18),0 0 22px rgba(236,197,90,.2)}
  .vip-crown{position:absolute;margin-top:-58px;font-size:18px}
  .cust-av.react{transform:scale(1.12)}
  .patience{width:140px;height:8px;background:#0E0D14;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}
  .patience > i{display:block;height:100%;width:100%;border-radius:99px;background:var(--good);transition:background .2s linear}
  .patience.invis{visibility:hidden}
  .dismiss-slot{min-height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .dismiss-btn{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);font-family:inherit;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s ease}
  .dismiss-btn:hover{border-color:var(--paper-dim);color:var(--paper)}
  .dismiss-btn.suggest{border-color:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);background:rgba(236,197,90,.08)}
  .dismiss-btn:active{transform:scale(.96)} .dismiss-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}
  .float-gold{position:absolute;left:50%;top:46%;transform:translateX(-50%);pointer-events:none;text-align:center;z-index:5;animation:floatUp 1s ease forwards}
  .float-gold .fg-main{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:24px;color:var(--gold);text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
  .float-gold .fg-bonus{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--good)}
  .float-gold .fg-pen{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--danger)}
  @keyframes floatUp{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(8px) scale(.9)}20%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-34px) scale(1.05)}}
  .section-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  .section-label span{color:var(--paper-faint);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;font-weight:500}
  .slot-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .slot{background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px 6px;min-height:104px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease}
  .slot.empty{border-style:dashed;color:var(--paper-faint)} .slot.empty .slot-empty{font-size:24px;opacity:.6}
  .slot.filled:active{transform:scale(.96)}
  .slot.pop{animation:slotpop .35s ease} @keyframes slotpop{0%{transform:scale(.85)}60%{transform:scale(1.06)}100%{transform:scale(1)}}
  .slot.match{border-color:var(--good);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--good),0 0 16px -4px var(--good)}
  .slot-glyph{font-size:30px;line-height:1}
  .slot-name{font-size:11px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;text-align:center;line-height:1.2}
  .slot-tag{font-size:10px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .slot-drag-over,.slot.drag-over{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--gold),0 0 18px -2px var(--gold);transform:scale(1.03)}
  .inv-row{display:flex;gap:9px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:14px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  .inv-row::-webkit-scrollbar{height:5px} .inv-row::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:99px}
  .inv-item{flex:0 0 auto;width:80px;background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:11px 6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:5px;cursor:grab;font-family:inherit;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease,opacity .15s ease;touch-action:pan-x;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none}
  .inv-item.dragging-src{opacity:.35}
  .inv-item.hot{border-color:var(--good)}
  .inv-item:active{transform:scale(.95)}
  .inv-glyph{font-size:26px;line-height:1}
  .inv-name{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;text-align:center;line-height:1.15;height:24px;overflow:hidden}
  .inv-tag{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700}
  .grade-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%}
  .empty-inv{flex:0 0 auto;color:var(--paper-faint);font-size:12.5px;padding:14px 4px}
  .shop-hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--paper-faint);text-align:center;line-height:1.5}
  .shop-empty{text-align:center;color:var(--paper-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;padding:30px 16px}
  .shop-empty b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .drag-ghost{position:fixed;z-index:100;pointer-events:none;width:84px;background:var(--ink-3);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.55);transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1.06);opacity:.97}
  .drag-ghost .inv-glyph{font-size:26px;line-height:1}
  .drag-ghost .inv-name{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;text-align:center;line-height:1.15}
  .drag-ghost .inv-tag{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  body.dragging,body.dragging *{cursor:grabbing !important}

  /* 성장 */
  .grow-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:18px 0 10px}
  .grow-card{background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .grow-card.current{background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 0% 0%,#262234,#181520)}
  .grow-card.hint{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);line-height:1.6} .grow-card.hint b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .grow-name{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:var(--paper);margin-bottom:14px}
  .grow-stage{font-family:"Noto Sans KR";font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);border:1px solid var(--gold-soft);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 9px;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:6px}
  .grow-stats{display:flex;gap:8px}
  .grow-stats > div{flex:1;background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 8px;text-align:center}
  .grow-stats span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
  .grow-stats b{font-family:"Noto Serif KR";font-size:16px;color:var(--paper)}
  .grow-stats b small{font-size:10px;color:var(--paper-faint);font-weight:700;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .grow-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .grow-up{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:var(--paper)}
  .grow-cost{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--gold);white-space:nowrap} .grow-cost.short{color:var(--danger)}
  .grow-eff{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin-bottom:12px} .grow-row .grow-eff{margin-bottom:0}
  .grow-fac{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px} .grow-fac-ico{font-size:26px} .grow-fac-name{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--paper)}
  .grow-owned{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--good);border:1px solid var(--good);border-radius:99px;padding:3px 11px;white-space:nowrap}
  .grow-btn{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-soft));color:#1A150A;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:11px;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s ease,transform .05s ease}
  .grow-btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)} .grow-btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .grow-btn:disabled{background:var(--ink-3);color:var(--paper-faint);cursor:not-allowed} .grow-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--paper);outline-offset:2px}
  .grow-test{width:100%;margin-top:8px;background:none;border:1px dashed var(--line);color:var(--paper-faint);font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer}
  .grow-test:hover{border-color:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold)}
  .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,9,14,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:80;padding:24px;animation:fade .25s ease}
  .modal{width:100%;max-width:340px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#231F2E,#171520);border:1px solid var(--gold-soft);border-radius:18px;padding:26px 22px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
  .modal-eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}
  .modal-title{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin:8px 0 12px;line-height:1.4}
  .claim-amount{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:900;font-size:40px;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;text-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(236,197,90,.3)}
  .claim-amount small{font-size:16px;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .claim-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--paper-faint);margin:10px 0 18px;min-height:14px}
  .modal .btn-primary{margin-bottom:8px}
  .claim-x2{width:100%;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:10px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s ease}
  .claim-x2:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}

  .nav{flex:none;display:flex;background:rgba(21,20,28,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom)}
  .nav-btn{flex:1;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--paper-faint);font-family:inherit;padding:12px 0 13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;transition:color .15s ease;position:relative}
  .nav-btn .nav-ico{font-size:19px;line-height:1} .nav-btn .nav-lab{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .nav-btn.active{color:var(--gold)} .nav-btn.active::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:26px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:99px}
  .nav-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:-4px}
  .toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:calc(84px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(10px);background:#2A2636;border:1px solid var(--gold-soft);color:var(--paper);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:99px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .3s ease;z-index:90;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
  .toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
  /* ===== 시장 (매입) ===== */
  .mkt-head{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:14px;background:#191722;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:11px 13px}
  .mkt-reroll{width:100%;margin-bottom:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(236,197,90,.14),rgba(236,197,90,.06));border:1px solid var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:11px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s ease,transform .05s ease}
  .mkt-reroll small{font-weight:600;color:var(--paper-dim)}
  .mkt-reroll:hover{filter:brightness(1.12)} .mkt-reroll:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .mkt-reroll:disabled{background:none;border-color:var(--line);color:var(--paper-faint);cursor:not-allowed}
  .mkt-head b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700} .mkt-head span{color:var(--paper-faint);font-size:11.5px}
  .mkt-card{background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px;margin-bottom:10px;transition:opacity .2s ease}
  .mkt-card.sold{opacity:.5}
  .mkt-card.rare{border-color:var(--gold-soft);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(201,154,51,.25)}
  .mkt-merchant{font-size:11px;color:var(--paper-faint);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}
  .mkt-body{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .mkt-glyph{font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex:none}
  .mkt-info{min-width:0}
  .mkt-name{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--paper);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .mkt-grade{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1A150A;border-radius:99px;padding:1px 8px;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .mkt-tag{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);font-weight:700;margin-top:3px}
  .mkt-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
  .mkt-price{font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-dim)}
  .mkt-price b{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;font-family:"Noto Serif KR"}
  .mkt-price small{color:var(--paper-faint);font-size:11px;margin-left:2px}
  .mkt-buy{flex:none;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-soft));color:#1A150A;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:9px 20px;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s ease,transform .05s ease}
  .mkt-buy:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)} .mkt-buy:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .mkt-buy:disabled{background:var(--ink-3);color:var(--paper-faint);cursor:not-allowed} .mkt-buy:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--paper);outline-offset:2px}
  /* ===== 액운 배너 ===== */
  .ward-banner{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2E1F22,#241519);border:1px solid var(--danger);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;color:#F0C9C2;line-height:1.5}
  .ward-banner b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .ward-banner .wb-title{font-weight:700;color:var(--danger);font-size:13.5px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px}
  .ward-banner.mini{padding:9px 13px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:12px}
  /* ===== 타로 미니게임 ===== */
  .tarot-sec{margin-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px}
  .tarot-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--paper)}
  .tarot-title span{font-weight:500;color:var(--paper-faint);font-size:12px}
  .tarot-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;justify-content:center}
  .tarot-card{flex:1;max-width:104px;background:none;border:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;perspective:820px;transition:transform .15s ease}
  .tarot-card[disabled]{cursor:default}
  .tc-inner{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/4.3;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
  .tc-inner.flip{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
  .tc-face{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px;text-align:center}
  .tc-back{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 32%,#2A2636,#15131E);font-size:30px;color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .tc-front{transform:rotateY(180deg);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#221F2D,#171520)}
  .tarot-card:not([disabled]):hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}
  .tarot-card.faded{opacity:.42}
  .tarot-card.chosen{transform:scale(1.05)}
  .tarot-card.chosen .tc-front{box-shadow:0 0 24px -4px var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .tc-ico{font-size:30px;line-height:1}
  .tc-amt{font-family:"Noto Serif KR";font-weight:900;font-size:15px;color:var(--gold)}
  .tc-name{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;line-height:1.2}
  .tc-grade{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1A150A;border-radius:99px;padding:1px 7px;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .tarot-again{width:100%;margin-top:14px;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:10px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s ease}
  .tarot-again:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
  /* ===== 공장 (자동생산) ===== */
  .fac-stat{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--paper-faint);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5}
  .fac-stat b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
  .rail-card{background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .rail-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  .rail-glyph{font-size:30px;flex:none;width:50px;height:50px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px}
  .rail-glyph.empty{color:var(--paper-faint);font-size:24px;border-style:dashed}
  .rail-info{min-width:0;flex:1}
  .rail-name{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--paper);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .rail-grade{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1A150A;border-radius:99px;padding:1px 8px;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .rail-sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin-top:3px}
  .rail-stock b{color:var(--gold)}
  .rail-bar{height:7px;background:#100F16;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin:11px 0}
  .rail-bar > i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold-soft),var(--gold));width:0;transition:width .5s linear}
  .rail-foot{display:flex;gap:8px}
  .rail-btn{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-soft));color:#1A150A;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s ease,transform .05s ease}
  .rail-btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)} .rail-btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .rail-btn:disabled{background:var(--ink-3);color:var(--paper-faint);cursor:not-allowed}
  .rail-btn.ghost{flex:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);padding:10px 14px}
  .rail-btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
  .rail-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--paper);outline-offset:2px}
  /* 품목 선택 모달 */
  .picker .modal{max-width:380px;text-align:left}
  .pk-title{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:var(--paper);margin-bottom:4px}
  .pk-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--paper-dim);margin-bottom:14px}
  .pk-grades{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
  .pk-grade{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:none;color:var(--paper-dim);cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
  .pk-grade.on{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold);background:rgba(236,197,90,.1)}
  .pk-grade:disabled{opacity:.32;cursor:not-allowed}
  .pk-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;max-height:288px;overflow-y:auto}
  .pk-grid::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px} .pk-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:99px}
  .pk-item{background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:border-color .15s ease}
  .pk-item:hover{border-color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .pk-glyph{font-size:24px;line-height:1}
  .pk-name{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--paper);text-align:center;line-height:1.15}
  .pk-gb{font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#1A150A;border-radius:99px;padding:1px 6px;margin-top:1px;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .pk-item.locked{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  .pk-item.locked:hover{border-color:var(--line)}
  .pk-tag{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
  .rail-tag{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
  .stat-pill.codex-open{cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s ease,color .15s ease}
  .stat-pill.codex-open:hover{border-color:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold)}
  .stat-pill.codex-open:active{transform:scale(.97)}
  /* 도감 */
  .codex-modal{max-width:404px}
  .cdx-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;max-height:60vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:2px}
  .cdx-grid::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px} .cdx-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:99px}
  .cdx-cell{background:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;min-height:90px;justify-content:center}
  .cdx-cell.got{border-color:rgba(236,197,90,.28)}
  .cdx-glyph{font-size:30px;line-height:1}
  .cdx-glyph.silhouette{filter:brightness(0) grayscale(1);opacity:.42}
  .cdx-gb{font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#1A150A;border-radius:99px;padding:1px 6px;font-family:"Noto Sans KR"}
  .cdx-name{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--paper);text-align:center;line-height:1.15}
  .cdx-name.muted{color:var(--paper-faint);letter-spacing:1px}
  .cdx-tag{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
  .pk-empty{color:var(--paper-faint);font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:24px 10px;line-height:1.6}
  .pk-close{width:100%;margin-top:14px;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper-dim);font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:10px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer}
  .pk-close:hover{border-color:var(--paper-dim);color:var(--paper)}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){*{animation:none !important;transition:none !important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <button id="sfxToggle" class="sfx-toggle" aria-label="효과음 켜기/끄기">🔊</button>
  <div class="ohaeng-strip" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
  <div class="stage">

    <section class="screen" data-screen="onboarding" id="onboarding">
      <div class="ob-brand">운명상회</div>
      <div class="ob-sub">운명을 읽기 위해, 당신을 알려주세요.</div>
      <div class="field"><label for="nickname">닉네임</label><input class="input" id="nickname" type="text" maxlength="12" placeholder="상점에 걸 이름" autocomplete="off"></div>
      <div class="field"><label>생년월일</label><div class="date-row"><select class="sel" id="birthYear" aria-label="해"></select><select class="sel" id="birthMonth" aria-label="달"></select><select class="sel" id="birthDay" aria-label="날"></select></div></div>
      <div class="field"><label>태어난 시 <span class="opt">· 선택</span></label><select class="sel" id="birthHour" aria-label="시"></select></div>
      <div class="err" id="obErr"></div>
      <button class="btn-primary" id="startBtn">내 운명 펼치기</button>
      <p class="ob-note">입력 정보는 이 기기에만 저장됩니다.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" data-screen="fortune" id="fortune">
      <div class="phase-badge">Phase 1 · 10초 루프</div>
      <div class="statusbar"><div class="stat-pill">🪙 <b class="gold" id="valGold">0</b> 냥</div><div class="stat-pill">🏮 <b id="valStage">—</b></div></div>
      <div class="scr-head"><div><div class="scr-eyebrow">오늘의 운세</div><h1 class="scr-title" id="fortuneGreeting">—</h1><div class="scr-meta" id="todayDate">—</div></div><button class="icon-btn" id="resetBtn">초기화</button></div>
      <div id="sealedView" class="sealed"><div class="seal-mark">🔮</div><p class="seal-text">오늘의 기운이 아직 봉인되어 있습니다.</p><button class="btn-primary" id="revealBtn">오늘의 운세 펼치기</button></div>
      <div id="revealView" hidden>
        <div class="stats" id="statsBox"></div>
        <div class="luck-row">
          <div class="luck-chip"><span class="color-dot" id="luckColorDot"></span><div><div class="luck-label">행운의 색</div><div class="luck-main" id="luckColorName">—</div></div></div>
          <div class="luck-chip"><span class="num-badge" id="luckNum">—</span><div><div class="luck-label">행운의 숫자</div><div class="luck-main">오늘의 길수</div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ward-banner" id="fortuneWard" hidden></div>
        <p class="fortune-comment" id="fortuneComment">—</p>
        <div class="reward-label">오늘의 행운 아이템</div>
        <div class="flip" id="itemCard"><div class="flip-inner">
          <div class="flip-face flip-back"><div class="bk-mark">☯</div><div class="bk-text">運命商會</div></div>
          <div class="flip-face flip-front"><div class="item-glyph" id="itemGlyph">🧧</div><div class="item-name" id="itemName">—</div><div class="grade-chip" id="itemGrade">—</div><div class="item-tags" id="itemTags"></div></div>
        </div></div>
        <p class="next-hint">다음 운세는 내일 · 보유 <b id="invCount">0</b>개</p>
        <div class="tarot-sec" id="tarotSec">
          <div class="tarot-title">🃏 오늘의 타로 <span id="tarotSub">— 한 장을 골라 운을 점쳐보세요</span></div>
          <div class="tarot-row" id="tarotRow"></div>
          <div id="tarotAgainWrap"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" data-screen="shop" id="shop">
      <div class="phase-badge">Phase 2 · 3분 루프</div>
      <div class="session-stats">
        <div class="sstat"><span>매출</span><b class="gold" id="ssGold">0</b></div>
        <div class="sstat"><span>콤보</span><b id="ssCombo">1.0×</b></div>
        <div class="sstat"><span>만족 손님</span><b id="ssServed">0</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ward-banner mini" id="shopWard" hidden></div>
      <div class="cust-stage" id="custStage"><div class="queue" id="custQueue"></div><div id="frontWrap"></div></div>
      <div class="section-label">진열대 <span id="slotLabel">· 전면</span></div>
      <div class="slot-row" id="slotRow"></div>
      <div class="section-label">인벤토리 <span>· 끌어서 진열 · ×수량</span></div>
      <div class="inv-row" id="invRow"></div>
      <p class="shop-hint">원하는 태그를 진열하면 자동 판매(재고 1 차감) · 슬롯 탭하면 비움 · 못 팔면 손님 내보내기</p>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" data-screen="growth" id="growth">
      <div class="phase-badge">Phase 3 · 1일 루프</div>
      <div class="statusbar"><div class="stat-pill">🪙 <b class="gold" id="gGold">0</b> 냥</div></div>
      <div id="growthBody"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" data-screen="market" id="market">
      <div class="phase-badge">시장 · 매입</div>
      <div class="statusbar"><div class="stat-pill">🪙 <b class="gold" id="mGold">0</b> 냥</div></div>
      <div id="marketBody"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" data-screen="factory" id="factory">
      <div class="phase-badge">공장 · 자동생산</div>
      <div class="statusbar"><div class="stat-pill">🏭 <b id="facTier">—</b></div><div class="stat-pill codex-open" id="codexBtn">📖 도감 <b id="facCodex">0</b>종 ›</div></div>
      <div id="factoryBody"></div>
    </section>

  </div>
  <nav class="nav" id="navBar">
    <button class="nav-btn" data-target="fortune"><span class="nav-ico">🔮</span><span class="nav-lab">운세</span></button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-target="shop"><span class="nav-ico">🏮</span><span class="nav-lab">상점</span></button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-target="growth"><span class="nav-ico">🏛️</span><span class="nav-lab">성장</span></button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-target="market"><span class="nav-ico">🛒</span><span class="nav-lab">시장</span></button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-target="factory"><span class="nav-ico">🏭</span><span class="nav-lab">공장</span></button>
